{"4847990":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":".Rise \/\/ Access","steam_appid":4847990,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4847990\/extras\/3bc1ed121cdbfd7d51e19ba5a9a7460f.avif?t=1789308360\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4847990\/extras_big\/3bc1ed121cdbfd7d51e19ba5a9a7460f.webp?t=1789308360 width=1560 height=680 \/><\/span><strong><br>.RISE \/\/ ACCESS<\/strong> is a Metroidvania fusing elements of versus fighting and shoot 'em up into high intensity combat, wrapped in an anime aesthetic packed with epic set pieces.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4847990\/extras\/e6195a93685e2b8b23c294be427c8795.avif?t=1789308360\" width=766 height=556 \/><\/span><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A young girl the last surviving member of the cat folk awakens inside an Ark housing the collective unconscious of countless extinct species. Guided by the voice of an enigmatic entity known as the Oracle, she attempts to escape this colossal structure.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However... <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4847990\/extras\/2e8a19b95b4e4d10ba35c938d0c58f23.avif?t=1789308360\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4847990\/extras_big\/2e8a19b95b4e4d10ba35c938d0c58f23.avif?t=1789308360 width=1560 height=848 \/><\/span><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Oracle appears consumed by an affliction slowly unraveling her mind. What initially presents itself as a motherly figure and an ally quickly turns into a vengeful beast, eaten away by overwhelming solitude. A struggle for survival and mutual understanding begins—if such a connection is even possible...<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration<\/strong><\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the Ark and meet the spirits dwelling within. Uncover the secrets of the past, carve your path, and discover your true identity.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4847990\/extras\/6fd34409c14ab2c876aeaa64d6a1f857.avif?t=1789308360\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4847990\/extras_big\/6fd34409c14ab2c876aeaa64d6a1f857.avif?t=1789308360 width=1560 height=848 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic Boss Fights<\/strong><\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounters blending close-quarters versus fighting, high-speed bullet hell flight sequences, and tightly choreographed positioning.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4847990\/extras\/34c61762e76730d29ebb4283b7f2e787.avif?t=1789308360\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4847990\/extras_big\/34c61762e76730d29ebb4283b7f2e787.avif?t=1789308360 width=1560 height=848 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Slayer<\/strong><\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield your arm—forged from forbidden technology—in combat.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4847990\/extras\/3eee378ed98973a911a3f36f00b2051f.avif?t=1789308360\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4847990\/extras_big\/3eee378ed98973a911a3f36f00b2051f.avif?t=1789308360 width=1560 height=848 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4847990\/extras\/3f528d7136c6c2d8151551a805a45335.poster.avif?t=1789308360\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4847990\/extras\/3f528d7136c6c2d8151551a805a45335.webm?t=1789308360\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4847990\/extras\/3f528d7136c6c2d8151551a805a45335.mp4?t=1789308360\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4847990\/extras\/fc74f948216e9d89bb842371151b1314.poster.avif?t=1789308360\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4847990\/extras\/fc74f948216e9d89bb842371151b1314.webm?t=1789308360\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4847990\/extras\/fc74f948216e9d89bb842371151b1314.mp4?t=1789308360\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Synergy<\/strong><\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harness and command the Ark's  forces.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4847990\/extras\/6bffa17ad880ea9e7ab94b6629114ed2.poster.avif?t=1789308360\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4847990\/extras\/6bffa17ad880ea9e7ab94b6629114ed2.webm?t=1789308360\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4847990\/extras\/6bffa17ad880ea9e7ab94b6629114ed2.mp4?t=1789308360\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Phantom Pain<\/strong><\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endure the phantom pain. Whatever happens, don't lose your arm...<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4847990\/extras\/fe49cf8f0dbc4ab757c71ba648487759.poster.avif?t=1789308360\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4847990\/extras\/fe49cf8f0dbc4ab757c71ba648487759.webm?t=1789308360\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4847990\/extras\/fe49cf8f0dbc4ab757c71ba648487759.mp4?t=1789308360\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Note from Novark Entertainment<\/strong><\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hello everyone!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are a young indie studio, each bringing our own unique background to the table, united by a shared passion for video games and anime.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our core team currently includes our Creative Director (with a background as a senior 3D animator), two developers, and a Production Director who keeps everything running smoothly! We are a small team looking to expand as funding allows, and we're already in touch with talented collaborators ready to help us bring our artistic vision to life.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>.RISE \/\/ ACCESS<\/strong> is currently in very early prototyping. While the core gameplay foundations are set, we still have a long journey ahead. Our goal is to develop transparently and build this game alongside our community.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We will regularly share our progress: music previews, character reveals, behind-the-scenes devlogs, and gameplay updates. While staying true to our artistic vision, your feedback, ideas, and player experiences will be invaluable in shaping the game throughout production.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're excited about the project, make sure to <strong>wishlist the game<\/strong> so you don't miss any upcoming announcements, and follow us on our social channels to chat directly with the team. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See you soon!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Novark Team<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4847990\/extras\/716d0c3173bc3b59346b2312a6d5bd79.avif?t=1789308360\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4847990\/extras_big\/716d0c3173bc3b59346b2312a6d5bd79.webp?t=1789308360 width=1560 height=1560 \/><\/span><\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4847990\/extras\/3bc1ed121cdbfd7d51e19ba5a9a7460f.avif?t=1789308360\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4847990\/extras_big\/3bc1ed121cdbfd7d51e19ba5a9a7460f.webp?t=1789308360 width=1560 height=680 \/><\/span><strong><br>.RISE \/\/ ACCESS<\/strong> is a Metroidvania fusing elements of versus fighting and shoot 'em up into high intensity combat, wrapped in an anime aesthetic packed with epic set pieces.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4847990\/extras\/e6195a93685e2b8b23c294be427c8795.avif?t=1789308360\" width=766 height=556 \/><\/span><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A young girl the last surviving member of the cat folk awakens inside an Ark housing the collective unconscious of countless extinct species. Guided by the voice of an enigmatic entity known as the Oracle, she attempts to escape this colossal structure.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However... <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4847990\/extras\/2e8a19b95b4e4d10ba35c938d0c58f23.avif?t=1789308360\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4847990\/extras_big\/2e8a19b95b4e4d10ba35c938d0c58f23.avif?t=1789308360 width=1560 height=848 \/><\/span><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Oracle appears consumed by an affliction slowly unraveling her mind. What initially presents itself as a motherly figure and an ally quickly turns into a vengeful beast, eaten away by overwhelming solitude. A struggle for survival and mutual understanding begins—if such a connection is even possible...<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration<\/strong><\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the Ark and meet the spirits dwelling within. Uncover the secrets of the past, carve your path, and discover your true identity.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4847990\/extras\/6fd34409c14ab2c876aeaa64d6a1f857.avif?t=1789308360\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4847990\/extras_big\/6fd34409c14ab2c876aeaa64d6a1f857.avif?t=1789308360 width=1560 height=848 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic Boss Fights<\/strong><\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounters blending close-quarters versus fighting, high-speed bullet hell flight sequences, and tightly choreographed positioning.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4847990\/extras\/34c61762e76730d29ebb4283b7f2e787.avif?t=1789308360\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4847990\/extras_big\/34c61762e76730d29ebb4283b7f2e787.avif?t=1789308360 width=1560 height=848 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Slayer<\/strong><\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield your arm—forged from forbidden technology—in combat.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4847990\/extras\/3eee378ed98973a911a3f36f00b2051f.avif?t=1789308360\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4847990\/extras_big\/3eee378ed98973a911a3f36f00b2051f.avif?t=1789308360 width=1560 height=848 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted l