e_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4847990\/extras\/6bffa17ad880ea9e7ab94b6629114ed2.mp4?t=1789308360\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Phantom Pain<\/strong><\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endure the phantom pain. Whatever happens, don't lose your arm...<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4847990\/extras\/fe49cf8f0dbc4ab757c71ba648487759.poster.avif?t=1789308360\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4847990\/extras\/fe49cf8f0dbc4ab757c71ba648487759.webm?t=1789308360\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4847990\/extras\/fe49cf8f0dbc4ab757c71ba648487759.mp4?t=1789308360\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Note from Novark Entertainment<\/strong><\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hello everyone!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are a young indie studio, each bringing our own unique background to the table, united by a shared passion for video games and anime.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our core team currently includes our Creative Director (with a background as a senior 3D animator), two developers, and a Production Director who keeps everything running smoothly! We are a small team looking to expand as funding allows, and we're already in touch with talented collaborators ready to help us bring our artistic vision to life.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>.RISE \/\/ ACCESS<\/strong> is currently in very early prototyping. While the core gameplay foundations are set, we still have a long journey ahead. Our goal is to develop transparently and build this game alongside our community.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We will regularly share our progress: music previews, character reveals, behind-the-scenes devlogs, and gameplay updates. While staying true to our artistic vision, your feedback, ideas, and player experiences will be invaluable in shaping the game throughout production.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're excited about the project, make sure to <strong>wishlist the game<\/strong> so you don't miss any upcoming announcements, and follow us on our social channels to chat directly with the team. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See you soon!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Novark Team<\/strong><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4847990\/extras\/716d0c3173bc3b59346b2312a6d5bd79.avif?t=1789308360\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4847990\/extras_big\/716d0c3173bc3b59346b2312a6d5bd79.webp?t=1789308360 width=1560 height=1560 \/><\/span><\/p>","short_description":"A fast-paced Metroidvania fusing versus fighting with shoot 'em up mechanics in intense choreographed combat. As the last survivor of the cat folk, awaken deep within the Ark. Guided by the Oracle, uncover the forbidden secrets of her mind slipping into madness.","supported_languages":"English, French, Simplified Chinese, Japanese","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4847990\/1e2f2aee7aa2c5898fee80216845a4ac8dfeaa35\/header.jpg?t=1789308360","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4847990\/ee210a47534dae4c216b49a10b7539c637b5a63e\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t